    "description": "This app helps you choose the perfect color palettes for your wardrobe, outfits and makeup based on natural features like your skin tone, hair and eye color, also taking into account the fashion trends.\r\n\r\nColors can be warm, neutral, cold, soft or saturated, dark or light. Every people has different physical attributes such as different skin tone, eye and hair color. That is why not all of the colors suit you well. Some of them are average for one people but brilliant for others.\r\n\r\nFill the seasonal color analysis quiz and follow your palettes that are in perfect harmony with your skin tone, hair and eye color.\r\n\r\nThe app is compatible with the 12 seasonal color system.\r\n\r\nBenefits of Color Analysis:\r\n- look younger, more powerful and beautiful using shades that bring out your natural beauty\r\n- easier and quicker shopping, you have to check clothes in your colors only\r\n- smaller wardrobe, clothes only with your best colors\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- more than 4500 outfit and makeup color suggestions\r\n- outfit palettes for each seasonal type: best and trend colors, full color range, combinations and neutrals\r\n- additional outfit palettes: colors for business wear, combinations for business and special occasion wear, accessories, jewelries, tips for color selection of sunglasses, colors to avoid\r\n- makeup palettes: lipsticks, eyeshadows, eyeliners, blushes, eyebrows\r\n- each color can be opened to full-display page\r\n- seasonal color analysis quiz\r\n- detailed description of each color type\r\n- user defined color cards via favorite colors function\r\n\r\nThe built-in quiz is not equivalent to a professional color analysis, however in many cases it can help give ideas for the possible palettes for anyone interested in seasonal types. If you already know your type, you can select the type and see your colors.\r\n\r\nIf you're having any issues with the app, please don't hesitate to contact us and we'll be glad to help.",
